.planning
.stack-work
**/.stack-work
*.md
# package.yaml is EXCLUDED deliberately: without this, `COPY . .` carries all
# seven of them in and the image's own (different) hpack regenerates every
# .cabal. The must-have "hpack never runs inside the image" is false otherwise,
# and the criterion "no COPY line names package.yaml" passes vacuously because
# `COPY . .` names nothing.
**/package.yaml
